## ⚡ Quickstart

### 1. Inisialisasi Environment
```bash
# Izinkan mise pada direktori ini (jika menggunakan mise)
mise trust

# Setup file .env dan install dependensi ke .venv
task setup
```

### 2. Menjalankan Layanan / Workflow
{% if project_archetype == 'api-service' %}
```bash
# Jalankan FastAPI dev server dengan auto-reload (port 8000)
task dev
```
Buka dokumentasi Swagger UI di: `http://localhost:8000/docs`
{% elif project_archetype == 'data-analytics' %}
```bash
# Buka Jupyter Lab untuk eksplorasi data
task notebook

# Eksekusi pipeline analisis & transformasi
task run
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'ai-ml' %}
```bash
# Jalankan skrip training model
task train

# Jalankan evaluasi model / skrip inference
task eval
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'pipeline-worker' %}
```bash
# Jalankan worker consumer background task
task worker
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'cli-tool' %}
```bash
# Jalankan perintah CLI lokal
task run -- --help
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'library-package' %}
```bash
# Build package wheel dan sdist
task build
```
{% endif %}

